			</div>
			</div><div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_3_4 et_pb_column_2  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child">
				
				
				
				
				<div id="accordion" class="et_pb_module et_pb_accordion et_pb_accordion_0">
				
				
				
				
				<div class="et_pb_toggle et_pb_module et_pb_accordion_item et_pb_accordion_item_0  et_pb_toggle_open">
				
				
				
				
				<h3 class="et_pb_toggle_title"></h3>
				<div class="et_pb_toggle_content clearfix"></div>
			</div><div class="et_pb_toggle et_pb_module et_pb_accordion_item et_pb_accordion_item_1  et_pb_toggle_close">
				
				
				
				
				<h3 class="et_pb_toggle_title">How much does a product inspection cost?</h3>
				<div class="et_pb_toggle_content clearfix"><p>💰 <strong>Our standard inspection rate starts at USD 280 per man-day</strong> across most of Asia.</p>
<ul>
<li>For <strong>Taiwan and South Korea</strong>, the rate is <strong>USD 380 per man-day</strong>.</li>
</ul>
<p>🚗 <strong>Travel &amp; Additional Costs</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>In <strong>Mainland China</strong>, the rate is <strong>all-inclusive</strong> — there are no extra travel charges.</li>
<li>In <strong>other countries</strong>, travel expenses may apply depending on the factory’s location.</li>
</ul>
<p><!-- notionvc: 431871cb-5e7a-468e-b80d-48491229fa89 --></p></div>
			</div><div class="et_pb_toggle et_pb_module et_pb_accordion_item et_pb_accordion_item_2  et_pb_toggle_close">
				
				
				
				
				<h3 class="et_pb_toggle_title">How much does a factory audit cost?</h3>
				<div class="et_pb_toggle_content clearfix"><p>Factory audits also start at <span style="font-weight: 600;">USD 280 per man-day</span>.</p></div>
			</div><div class="et_pb_toggle et_pb_module et_pb_accordion_item et_pb_accordion_item_3  et_pb_toggle_close">
				
				
				
				
				<h3 class="et_pb_toggle_title">Do you offer discounts for bulk or recurring services?</h3>
				<div class="et_pb_toggle_content clearfix">Yes — for <strong>enterprise accounts</strong> .</p>
<p>Discounts depend on your <strong>monthly inspection volume and total man-days</strong>.</div>
			</div><div class="et_pb_toggle et_pb_module et_pb_accordion_item et_pb_accordion_item_4  et_pb_toggle_close">
				
				
				
				
				<h3 class="et_pb_toggle_title">Are there any hidden fees or additional costs?</h3>
				<div class="et_pb_toggle_content clearfix"><p>No hidden fees.</p>
<p>You’ll only be charged for:</p>
<ul>
<li>💼 <strong>Service fee (per man-day)</strong></li>
<li>🚗 <strong>Travel expenses</strong>, if applicable (outside China or remote areas)</li>
</ul></div>
			</div><div class="et_pb_toggle et_pb_module et_pb_accordion_item et_pb_accordion_item_5  et_pb_toggle_close">
				
				
				
				
				<h3 class="et_pb_toggle_title">Can you provide a detailed breakdown of your pricing?</h3>
				<div class="et_pb_toggle_content clearfix"><p>Of course. Your quote will include:</p>
<ul>
<li>✅ Number of <strong>man-days required</strong></li>
<li>✅ <strong>Rate per man-day</strong></li>
<li>✅ <strong>Estimated travel costs</strong>, if any</li>
</ul></div>
			</div><div class="et_pb_toggle et_pb_module et_pb_accordion_item et_pb_accordion_item_6  et_pb_toggle_close">
				
				
				
				
				<h3 class="et_pb_toggle_title">Do you charge extra for travel to remote factory locations?</h3>
				<div class="et_pb_toggle_content clearfix"><ul>
<li>🚫 In <strong>China</strong>, there’s <strong>no extra travel charge</strong></li>
<li>🌍 In <strong>other countries</strong>, additional charges <strong>may apply</strong> for remote factory locations, depending on inspector availability</li>
</ul></div>
			</div><div class="et_pb_toggle et_pb_module et_pb_accordion_item et_pb_accordion_item_7  et_pb_toggle_close">
				
				
				
				
				<h3 class="et_pb_toggle_title">Can we get a quote before committing to a service?</h3>
				<div class="et_pb_toggle_content clearfix">Yes, always!</p>
<p>We provide a <strong>clear quote before every inspection</strong>, and sometimes <strong>multiple options</strong> based on different scopes or man-day estimates.</div>
			</div><div class="et_pb_toggle et_pb_module et_pb_accordion_item et_pb_accordion_item_8  et_pb_toggle_close">
				
				
				
				
				<h3 class="et_pb_toggle_title">Do you offer package deals for multiple inspections or audits?</h3>
				<div class="et_pb_toggle_content clearfix"><p>We usually apply a <strong>fixed rate per man-day</strong> and calculate pricing based on the <strong>total man-days required</strong>.</p>
<p>We don’t offer bundled package deals, but enterprise discounts may apply for large volumes.</p></div>
			</div><div class="et_pb_toggle et_pb_module et_pb_accordion_item et_pb_accordion_item_9  et_pb_toggle_close">
				
				
				
				
				<h3 class="et_pb_toggle_title">How do you handle payment terms and invoicing?</h3>
				<div class="et_pb_toggle_content clearfix"><ul>
<li>💳 Payment in advance for every order.</li>
<li>🧾 <strong>Regular enterprise clients</strong>: Monthly invoicing, typically with <strong>20-day payment terms</strong> after invoice issuance</li>
</ul></div>
			</div><div class="et_pb_toggle et_pb_module et_pb_accordion_item et_pb_accordion_item_10  et_pb_toggle_close">
				
				
				
				
				<h3 class="et_pb_toggle_title">Do you charge for re-inspections if the first inspection fails?</h3>
				<div class="et_pb_toggle_content clearfix"><p>Yes. A <strong>re-inspection is charged at the same rate</strong> as a regular inspection, as it requires the same preparation, scheduling, and on-site work.</p>
<p><!-- notionvc: f83e5811-922f-41e3-8e91-d622aa65a09e --></p>
<p><!-- notionvc: fc57f921-9608-4f90-801f-6133ccf298d1 --></p></div>
			</div>
			</div>
			</div>
				
				
				
				
			</div>
				
				
			</div>		</div>
	</div>
						</div>

				
				</article>

			

</div>

